pdftomd includes code ported from the following MIT-licensed projects.

pdf2md.py
  Heuristics ported from Firecrawl's pdf-inspector
  https://github.com/firecrawl/pdf-inspector
  Symbol and ZapfDingbats encoding tables from pdf-inspector's src/extractor/base14.rs.
  Wingdings 1-3 code -> Unicode mappings: Unicode Technical Committee document L2/12-368
  (as tabulated in Wikipedia's "Wingdings" article).

tests/fixtures/symbol_builtin_encoding.pdf, symbol_builtin_encoding.expected.md
  pdf-inspector's test fixture and snapshot.

sheet2md.py
  Port of the spreadsheet, CSV, header-row and table-rendering code in anydoc
  (src/formats/sheet, src/formats/csv.rs, src/shared/header.rs, src/render/markdown)
  https://github.com/firecrawl/anydoc

tests/test_sheet.py
  Test cases ported from anydoc's own tests.

msg2md.py
  Read side of the cfb crate (compound files): https://github.com/mdsteele/rust-cfb
  RTF tokens as anydoc's src/formats/rtf/lexer.rs reads them: https://github.com/firecrawl/anydoc
  Port of firecrawl/html-to-markdown with its GitHub-flavored and robust code block plugins
  (the converter Firecrawl uses for web pages): https://github.com/firecrawl/html-to-markdown

tests/html2md/
  Input and expected-output pairs copied from html-to-markdown's testdata.

